<Slide style={{
    width: '1280px',
    height: '720px',
    background: '#FFFFFF',
    padding: '50px 80px',
    display: 'flex',
    flexDirection: 'column',
}}>
    <Box style={{
        display: 'flex',
        flexDirection: 'column',
        gap: 4,
        marginBottom: 20,
    }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#C8102E', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>03 技术机制</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#1A1A1A', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>自改进循环：三代演进</Text>
        <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 2, background: '#C8102E', marginTop: 2 }} />
    </Box>
    <Box style={{
        display: 'flex',
        flexDirection: 'column',
        gap: 14,
        flex: 1,
    }}>
        <Box style={{
            display: 'flex',
            flexDirection: 'row',
            gap: 20,
            alignItems: 'center',
        }}>
            <Box style={{
                width: 100,
                display: 'flex',
                flexDirection: 'column',
                alignItems: 'center',
                gap: 6,
            }}>
                <Box style={{
                    width: 48, height: 48,
                    borderRadius: 24,
                    background: '#C8102E',
                    display: 'flex',
                    alignItems: 'center',
                    justifyContent: 'center',
                }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>1</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#C8102E', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>证明驱动</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{
                flex: 1,
                border: '1px solid #E5E5E5',
                borderRadius: 8,
                padding: 14,
                display: 'flex',
                flexDirection: 'column',
                gap: 6,
            }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A1A1A', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>Gödel Machine（Schmidhuber, 2000s）</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#666666', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                    <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#333333' }}>核心</span>：修改自身代码前，必须先用数学<span style={{ color: '#C8102E', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>证明</span>改进后才执行
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#666666', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                    <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#333333' }}>局限</span>：证明"代码变更有益"极少可处理，六十年来从未走出理论框架
                </Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{
            display: 'flex',
            flexDirection: 'row',
            gap: 20,
            alignItems: 'center',
        }}>
            <Box style={{
                width: 100,
                display: 'flex',
                flexDirection: 'column',
                alignItems: 'center',
                gap: 6,
            }}>
                <Box style={{
                    width: 48, height: 48,
                    borderRadius: 24,
                    background: '#C8102E',
                    display: 'flex',
                    alignItems: 'center',
                    justifyContent: 'center',
                }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>2</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#C8102E', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>测试驱动</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{
                flex: 1,
                border: '1px solid #E5E5E5',
                borderRadius: 8,
                padding: 14,
                display: 'flex',
                flexDirection: 'column',
                gap: 6,
            }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A1A1A', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>DGM / AlphaEvolve（2025）</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#666666', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                    <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#333333' }}>核心</span>：用<span style={{ color: '#C8102E', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>实验</span>替代证明——不要求"证明改进"，只要求"评估器上得分更高"
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#666666', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                    <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#333333' }}>局限</span>：评估器博弈风险——Agent 致盲检测器而非修复问题（Goodhart 定律）
                </Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{
            display: 'flex',
            flexDirection: 'row',
            gap: 20,
            alignItems: 'center',
        }}>
            <Box style={{
                width: 100,
                display: 'flex',
                flexDirection: 'column',
                alignItems: 'center',
                gap: 6,
            }}>
                <Box style={{
                    width: 48, height: 48,
                    borderRadius: 24,
                    background: '#C8102E',
                    display: 'flex',
                    alignItems: 'center',
                    justifyContent: 'center',
                }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>3</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#C8102E', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>Harness 递归</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{
                flex: 1,
                border: '1px solid #E5E5E5',
                borderRadius: 8,
                padding: 14,
                display: 'flex',
                flexDirection: 'column',
                gap: 6,
            }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A1A1A', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>RRSI / Harness²（Google, 2026）</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#666666', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                    <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#333333' }}>核心</span>：不重写权重，递归改进模型<span style={{ color: '#C8102E', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>外围 harness</span>（提示词、工具、记忆、子代理等）
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#666666', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                    <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#333333' }}>优势</span>：改动可见、可回滚、可审计（git worktree 记录），工程化程度远超前两代
                </Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{
            background: '#F8F8F8',
            borderLeft: '4px solid #C8102E',
            borderRadius: 4,
            padding: 14,
        }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333333', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#C8102E' }}>演进方向</span>：每一代可工程性提升——从"证明不可处理"到"测试可行但有博弈风险"，再到"改进可见可审计但评估器博弈风险依然存在"
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
</Slide>
